+## JavaScript / TypeScript and web runtimes
+
+Discover Node.js, Bun, Deno, browser, Electron or an embedded runtime; inspect the
+actual package manager/lockfile, `package.json` scripts/engines/type, ESM/CommonJS,
+TypeScript config, bundler, test runner and framework versions. Inspect project scripts
+and install hooks before running them. Do not use unpinned `npx` as an implicit install.
