+syntax and `node --test <actual-test-file>` when the project uses Node's test runner.
+Use the project's existing lint/typecheck/test/build scripts for other setups. A
+syntax check is not TypeScript checking or browser testing. TypeScript `--noEmit`
+checks types only; browser interaction needs the existing browser test environment.
+Do not replace Jest/Vitest/Playwright or a framework's tests with a new runner merely
+because a built-in command is convenient.
