+stream backpressure, workers, cleanup and retries. Do not call CPU-heavy synchronous
+work nonblocking because its caller is async. Review prototype pollution, unsafe
+dynamic evaluation, injection, authn/authz, hydration/SSR boundaries, web storage and
+trusted state ownership when relevant. Measure event-loop latency and render/network
+costs before claiming improvements.
