+
+At Go/Rust/Lua/JavaScript boundaries verify the actual transport or FFI contract:
+encoding, integer ranges, signedness, byte order, null/nil/missing values, float
+precision, buffer ownership, GC/lifetimes, error and panic translation, thread
+requirements, version negotiation and cancellation. Preserve existing wire/API/schema
+contracts. Language checklists do not justify a rewrite or a new abstraction.
